                                "sense_id": "554165cc-56c8-3ed8-bb42-280f2525184d",
                                "text": "[…]the conference will host an international lineup of climate scientists and researchers who will focus on four broad areas: climatology, paleoclimatology, the impact of climate change, and climate-change politics and economics."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6adccec5-ea52-47f4-a358-86be090de34f",
                                "sense_id": "554165cc-56c8-3ed8-bb42-280f2525184d",
                                "text": "Paleoclimatology -- the study of ice cores and ocean sediment cores -- indicates that the planet is warming 10 times fast than the average warming following an ice age, she added."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
